Tell me what to do.

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:03.890
她：让她压上门闩
Her: Tell her to bolt the door
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:06.090
好了，锁上了。
Done. It's locked.

